image and in release bundles. The components and their licenses:

Camoufox (Python package)
  https://github.com/daijro/camoufox
  MIT License. Imported as a dependency; Moltskin does not modify or vendor
  its source.

Camoufox browser build (patched Firefox)
  https://github.com/daijro/camoufox
  Mozilla Public License 2.0 (MPL-2.0), inherited from Firefox.
  Moltskin launches this build unmodified as a separate process. When the
  binary is redistributed (Docker image, installer), recipients must be able
  to obtain the corresponding source; see the Camoufox and Mozilla
  repositories. If you patch any MPL-2.0 covered file, those files must be
  made available under the MPL-2.0.

GeoIP database
  Downloaded at first run into the user's cache directory and not bundled by
  Moltskin. The combined MaxMind-format database is published by the Camoufox
  project; the underlying data is subject to MaxMind GeoLite2 terms
  (CC BY-SA 4.0). Redistributing the database requires attribution.

